{
  "version": 3,
  "name": "ADR Compex F760X-RS Model",
  "category": "Dynamics",
  "author": "LiveWDF",
  "description": "One transformerless F760X-RS lane reconstructed from the ADR/Q2 Audio control and alignment documentation. The JFET variloss stage receives separate analog compressor, peak limiter and expander/gate controls. Gate keys from the output, Expand keys from the input, and all three control voltages mix at the FET bias. Values, timing and proprietary amplifier details are approximated. External insert, stereo link and meters are excluded.",
